?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3baad7415230ed7e26ffe39e8dbf996a", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/da9c83ff/uploads/origins/e7a62b74-03bd-4e78-b535-c60c5392fe34?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3baad7415230ed7e26ffe39e8dbf996a, https://si.imgix.net/da9c83ff/uploads/origins/e7a62b74-03bd-4e78-b535-c60c5392fe34?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b65728eb5d9a47e51c08b0920b1f31d3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/da9c83ff/uploads/origins/e7a62b74-03bd-4e78-b535-c60c5392fe34?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=80a74dcf63fad0b1438b26904ec55388 3x"}, "body": "Hi! Your style looks really cool!!\n\nWould you be able to do a full-body drawing of my character?\nMy character is a plant girl!\n\nReferences: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1uev8jDIaAyN6ecN64beW6l_xJISpxJWp?usp=sharing\nThe pose reference and character references are included in there!\n\nIn the middle of a fight, make them look angry with their eyes half open, looking up\nMake them look a little roughed up with maybe a small amount of blood coming from their mouth\n\nPlease keep the pattern on the right side of the cloak as seen in the cloak_reference.png image!\nIt would be cool to see them wearing fingerless leather gloves as seen in the glove_reference.png image\n\nAlso please send a version with a transparent background if you can :)\nThank you!!\n\nMake it great!!\n\n--------------------------\nTRANSLATION / 翻:\n\nこんにちは！スタイルがすごくかっこいいですね！\n\n私のキャラクターの全身を描いていただけますか？\n私のキャラクターは植物少女です！\n\n参考資料：https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1uev8jDIaAyN6ecN64beW6l_xJISpxJWp?usp=sharing\nポーズリファレンスとキャラクターリファレンスはここにあります！\n\n戦闘中は、目を半開きにして上を見上げ、怒っているような表情にしてください。\n口から少し血が流れているなど、少し荒っぽい表情にしてください。\n\nマントの右側の模様は、cloak_reference.png 画像のようにそのままにしてください！\nglove_reference.png 画像のように、指なし革手袋をはめている姿も見てもらえると嬉しいです。\n\nできれば背景を透明にしたバージョンも送ってくださいね :)\nありがとうございます！\n\n素晴らしいものにしてください!!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1uev8jDIaAyN6ecN64beW6l_xJISpxJWp?usp=sharing", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@iiiijw458/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1458fb65/uploads/origins/baf9d8ad-fbb7-4c36-a106-47f5168263fe?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=aee6b59bb50e5854c5b4269cf5c0acc9", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1458fb65/uploads/origins/baf9d8ad-fbb7-4c36-a106-47f5168263fe?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=aee6b59bb50e5854c5b4269cf5c0acc9, https://si.imgix.net/1458fb65/uploads/origins/baf9d8ad-fbb7-4c36-a106-47f5168263fe?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=9a01fa1a37d1e5068bab33de6c681d06 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1458fb65/uploads/origins/baf9d8ad-fbb7-4c36-a106-47f5168263fe?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=30804dea7e13356d08bd29db85a84314 3x"}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2772523, "client_id": 3621858, "nc": 129}, {"path": "/@iiiijw458/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/94d661c2/uploads/origins/07635a37-1e76-4256-8b83-6200d6d24de2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=7c11712594619915746d948d42b5c92d", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/94d661c2/uploads/origins/07635a37-1e76-4256-8b